00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.200
It sounds like you love them a lot!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:57.960
And they don't do any bad 
business or anything!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.360
They don't!

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:01.820
