00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.490
When joining a group living environment, 
first impressions are crucial.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.150
You gotta establish dominance 
right off the bat.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.340
Really?

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.890
